              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "سہارا — sahārā — \"a support; someone to lean on\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "اگر آپ کا سہارا نہ ہوتا تو میں گر جاتا۔ agar āp kā sahārā na hotā to maiṅ gir jātā. If you had not held me up, I would have fallen."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
