              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ضد — zid — \"stubbornness; insistence\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "اگر تم نے ضد کی تو کچھ نہیں ملے گا۔ agar tum ne zid kī to kuchh nahīṅ mile gā. If you are stubborn, you will get nothing."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ضد (zid) is usually traced, through Persian, to Arabic ḍidd, \"the opposite\"; Urdu uses it for stubborn insistence, a sense our sources do not trace."
            }
          ]
        },
